@startuml
' mb-scaffold: one spec in, a complete service project out.
' Both the CLI and the GUI wizard drive the same emitter code.
' Rendered into docs/architecture/overview.md.

skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam roundCorner 6

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #7A7A7A
}

title Scaffold generator — spec to project tree

left to right direction

rectangle "spec\n(CLI flags or YAML)"                                  as Spec
rectangle "CLI / GUI wizard"                                           as UI
rectangle "FastAPI bridge\ndelegates to cpp_tmpl.py"                   as Bridge
rectangle "out/<svc>/\nproto/  src/  deploy/\nbuild_*.bat  README"     as Out

Spec   --> UI
UI     --> Bridge : POST /api/scaffold/generate-v2
Bridge --> Out    : writes files

@enduml
